---
/**
 * Archived Post Warning Component
 * 
 * Displays a warning banner for archived posts that are kept for historical purposes.
 * Matches the Jekyll archived post warning functionality.
 * Uses the shared callout styles (global.css) so it matches :::warning callouts.
 */
---

<div class="callout callout-warning !mt-0" role="note">
  <strong class="callout-label"><span class="callout-icon" aria-hidden="true">⚠️</span> Heads up!</strong> This post is archived and here for historical purposes. It may no longer be accurate or reflect my views. Proceed at your own risk.
</div>
